  "details": "_VRChatCameraMode indicates an unexpected value when mirrors are in the camera's view.\n\nThe shader for the cube in the video draws red if _VRChatCameraMode==1. It works as expected if no mirrors in the camera's view, but it is broken if a mirror appeared.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1F4mF81mh9WksIpOBXxA7YoslaUC1VuGQ/view?usp=sharing\n\n# How to reproduce\n\n1. Prepare a shader that behaves differently by _VRChatCameraMode\n\n2. Try to take photo to frame the prepared object and a mirror simultaneously",
